WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,890 --> 00:00:02,090
Then how did you hit it?

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,050
Shotgun and good luck

3
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:07,950
Brother Qin, wait until the house is built

4
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:09,470
Are you going to marry my sister?

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,780
Xiaoshan, stop talking nonsense.

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,540
I'm not talking nonsense

7
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:14,740
Everyone in the village says so

8
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,420
He said that my sister will be the mistress of this house from now on.

9
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,780
Children's house, don't talk nonsense

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:28,180
Brother Qin, do you think it is a hill?

11
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,580
Wait until the house is built

12
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:30,820
I will go to your house to propose marriage

13
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,500
From now on we will be a family

14
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:37,640
Can I call you brother-in-law now?

15
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,100
Leave in a while

16
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,700
Take the fruits and particles home and eat them slowly

17
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,980
A Tian, proposing marriage is a big deal

18
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,220
Gotta follow the rules

19
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,300
I know Shen Zi is waiting for the house to be finished.

20
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,420
I asked Captain Wang to make coal

21
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:56,660
Officially go to your home to propose marriage
